start_6a6c900f		Advice: Ask questions before making commitments.	game/script.rpy	357	"[what]"
start_06308030		If a deadline is at risk, raise the issue early rather than waiting until the situation becomes urgent.	game/script.rpy	359	"[what]"
start_a6b178b4		Based on your chosen responses, you demonstrated constructive communication by and discussing expectations with others.	game/script.rpy	362	"[what]"
