start_f012086b		Clarify priorities, involve relevant staff and agree who is responsible for each action.	game/script.rpy	382	"[what]"
start_567b164e		You demonstrated consideration for the charity's needs while recognising that responsibility should be shared.	game/script.rpy	385	"[what]"
start_10da12a7		Advice: Continue balancing organisational priorities with individual capacity.	game/script.rpy	387	"[what]"
start_0ea0334b		Effective leadership means supporting the charity without assuming that one person must solve every problem.	game/script.rpy	389	"[what]"
